Package: enrichhelper
Title: Helper Functions for Gene Set Enrichment Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R:
    person("Jelmer", "Poelstra", , "jelmerpoelstra@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Wrapper functions around 'clusterProfiler' for over-representation
    analysis (ORA) and gene set enrichment analysis (GSEA), using either a
    Bioconductor 'OrgDb' or a manually supplied term-to-gene map, plus a
    Cleveland dotplot visualization for enrichment results.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
biocViews: GeneSetEnrichment, GO
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
