    AnnotationDbi,
    clusterProfiler,
    colorspace,
    dplyr,
    GO.db,
    ggforce,
    ggplot2,
    ggpubr,
    GOSemSim,
    grid,
    methods,
    purrr,
    rlang,
    scico,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    tidyr
Suggests:
    DESeq2,
    org.Hs.eg.db,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
